ad is the \"Sovereign t2r/t2rs harness\"** â€” a brain-agnostic agentic harness (clean ReAct loop, cache-stable routing, cost telemetry, provider portability) intended to host three interchangeable brains: Opus-4.8 baseline, the efficient t2r brain, and a fully-local/sovereign OSS brain. It's at milestone M1 (feature-complete for Google + Anthropic), with a Crucible-forged, Foreman-ready multi-wave plan to take it to GA. (`CLAUDE.md` â†’ \"Recently completed\"; memory index)\n\n- **Versioning:** the system is at `v2.1` (gen-2 dynamic-context t2r brain + gen-1 harness), tracked separately from a v0â†’v2 agent-maturity ladder. (`VERSIONING.md`)\n\nOne caveat worth flagging: the bullets above describe what the docs *claim* ships. I haven't re-verified the running code in this turn â€” if you want, I can confirm any specific claim (e.g., that the GUI server actually boots, or that `alpha-v0`'s dispatcher exists) against the filesystem."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7051,"cache_read_input_tokens":40827,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":7051,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"41d09d02-04ee-4b75-b845-45798b59b5d1","uuid":"ea34562d-edcd-4c56-8df5-7cd720ec1ddc","request_id":"req_011Cc2N3YZWn1FsUDJKUvHD9"}
